      "content": "The generation check drops only the final result; the old verification's `onProgress` still calls `setChecking` directly. If it emits progress after the next download clears `checking`, the new backup shows the old check's progress and its Verify button becomes disabled. When the old check finishes, this early return leaves that stale checking state in place indefinitely. Guard the progress callback with the same generation comparison, and extend the regression test to emit progress after the replacement download.",
