      "content": "Capture the download generation before awaiting `selectFile.choose()`, and check it again when selection resolves. Currently, if another download starts while selection is pending, this captures the new generation even though `expected` still belongs to the old download. That verification can consequently publish `Backup complete` for the old artifact under the new backup. A deferred file-selection test would cover this race.",
